# ScamShield AI

Multi-Modal AI Scam Detection & Risk Intelligence Platform

ScamShield AI is a multi-modal scam detection platform that analyzes SMS/text, URLs, screenshots, and social-engineering conversations to identify potential scams and generate a 0–100 risk score with explanations.

## Features

- Text & SMS Scam Detection
- URL & Typosquatting Detection
- Screenshot OCR Analysis
- Multi-Turn Scam Conversation Analysis
- Multilingual Support – English, Hindi, Tamil & Telugu
- Risk Score & Threat Level
- Explainable AI using SHAP
- Threat Intelligence Dashboard
- User Authentication & Scan History
- Admin Security & Incident Reporting

## Tech Stack

Backend: Python, FastAPI
ML: Scikit-learn, XGBoost, SHAP
OCR: Tesseract, Pillow
Database: SQLite, SQLAlchemy
Frontend: HTML, CSS, Bootstrap, JavaScript, Chart.js
Security: JWT, Bcrypt

## How It Works

User Input
→ Text / URL / Screenshot / Conversation
→ Detection & Feature Extraction
→ Risk Scoring Engine
→ Threat Classification
→ Explanation + Security Recommendation

## Run Locally

git clone https://github.com/your-username/scamshield-ai.git
cd scamshield-ai

python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate

pip install -r requirements.txt
python run.py

Application: http://127.0.0.1:8000
API Documentation: http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs

## Project Objective

The goal is to provide more than a simple Safe/Scam label by identifying suspicious indicators, calculating risk, explaining the prediction, and providing actionable security recommendations.

## Disclaimer

This project is an academic/final-year project. Model performance depends on the available demonstration dataset and should not be considered production-level security performance.

